532
00:46:25.995 --> 00:46:28.623
Sila ambil perhatian video ini.

533
00:46:31.209 --> 00:46:32.794
Video diserahkan tanpa nama.

534
00:46:33.628 --> 00:46:35.755
Rakaman ini membuktikannya

535
00:46:35.838 --> 00:46:38.841
